import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 637 | Time-Domain Philosophy | The Dual-Track Time Domain's Realization of \\"Time Fairness\\"","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 637 | Time-Domain Philosophy | The Dual-Track Time Domain's Realization of \\"Time Fairness\\"","no":637,"module":3,"tags":["Time-Domain Philosophy","Time Fairness","Distributive Justice","Dual-Track Time Domain","Myriad-Race Republicanism"],"related":["06-More-Work-More-Gain Distribution Principle","22-Resource Allocation Joint-Contracting Mechanism","08-Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0637_模块3-时间域哲学-双轨时间域对时间公平的实现.md","filePath":"en/0637_模块3-时间域哲学-双轨时间域对时间公平的实现.md"}`),o={name:"en/0637_模块3-时间域哲学-双轨时间域对时间公平的实现.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,m,u){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-637-time-domain-philosophy-the-dual-track-time-domain-s-realization-of-time-fairness" tabindex="-1">Entry 637 | Time-Domain Philosophy | The Dual-Track Time Domain&#39;s Realization of &quot;Time Fairness&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-637-time-domain-philosophy-the-dual-track-time-domain-s-realization-of-time-fairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 637 | Time-Domain Philosophy | The Dual-Track Time Domain&#39;s Realization of &quot;Time Fairness&quot;&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 06, 22, 08 | Series: Time-Domain Philosophy (Entry 4)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-time-fairness-is-the-last-puzzle-piece-of-myriad-race-republicanism" tabindex="-1">Introduction: time fairness is the last puzzle piece of Myriad-Race Republicanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-time-fairness-is-the-last-puzzle-piece-of-myriad-race-republicanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: time fairness is the last puzzle piece of Myriad-Race Republicanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In resource-allocation philosophy, land fairness, wealth fairness, knowledge fairness have all been repeatedly discussed, but &quot;time fairness&quot; has almost never been seriously treated. Predatory-faction systems default time as a personal matter — how long you live is your business, how long you use is your business; no one feels this needs distributive justice. But the dual-track time-domain system reveals an overlooked truth: <strong>when time flow may be technically regulated, time becomes an allocable resource, and the justice of time allocation is republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39; final fulfillment in the time dimension</strong>.</p><p>Six top-level axioms take effect here: anti-predation axiom requires time not be plundered and monopolized; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires time allocation equal to all beings; collective ascension axiom requires time investment ultimately serve joint progress; causal self-discipline axiom requires time allocation not create causal injustice; law-first axiom requires time-allocation law stable and self-consistent. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry asks: <strong>how does the dual-track time domain realize time fairness? Why is this fairness the last puzzle piece of Myriad-Race Republicanism?</strong></p><h2 id="i-three-historical-forms-of-time-unfairness" tabindex="-1">I. Three Historical Forms of Time Unfairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-historical-forms-of-time-unfairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Historical Forms of Time Unfairness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In predatory-faction civilizations, time unfairness exists in three forms:</p><h3 id="_1-1-lifespan-unfairness" tabindex="-1">1.1 Lifespan Unfairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-lifespan-unfairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Lifespan Unfairness&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The strong live forever; mortals go through birth, aging, illness, death. The strong live ten thousand years, mortals live a hundred — the same &quot;lifetime,&quot; time windows differ a hundredfold. This gap is not the result of effort, but the product of predatory cultivation: the strong extend their own lifespan by devouring others&#39; energy.</p><h3 id="_1-2-flow-unfairness" tabindex="-1">1.2 Flow Unfairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-flow-unfairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Flow Unfairness&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The strong may seclude, may enter time secret realms, may use time-accelerating treasures; mortals may only labor in normal flow. Within the same physical time, the strong&#39;s effective cultivation time is mortals&#39; hundredfold, thousandfold.</p><h3 id="_1-3-exit-unfairness" tabindex="-1">1.3 Exit Unfairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-exit-unfairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Exit Unfairness&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The strong may exit time at any moment — use time stop, time reversal, reincarnation rebirth to evade errors and death; mortals have no such choice, one wrong step leads to eternal damnation.</p><p>Three unfairness stacked constitutes the predatory-faction system&#39;s most fundamental time injustice: <strong>the strong through various means occupy Myriad Ranks&#39; time</strong>.</p><h2 id="ii-the-dual-track-time-domain-s-three-corrections-of-time-fairness" tabindex="-1">II. The Dual-Track Time Domain&#39;s Three Corrections of Time Fairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-dual-track-time-domain-s-three-corrections-of-time-fairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Dual-Track Time Domain&#39;s Three Corrections of Time Fairness&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-qualification-fairness-all-may-use" tabindex="-1">2.1 Qualification Fairness: All May Use <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-qualification-fairness-all-may-use" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Qualification Fairness: All May Use&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Origin Acceleration Domain and Quest Sediment Domain&#39;s use qualification is equally open to all beings of Myriad Ranks. Regardless of race, birth, gender, as long as passing basic cultivation-ethical assessment, may apply. This directly corresponds to Document 08 &quot;Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System.&quot;</p><h3 id="_2-2-allocation-fairness-more-work-more-gain" tabindex="-1">2.2 Allocation Fairness: More Work More Gain <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-allocation-fairness-more-work-more-gain" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Allocation Fairness: More Work More Gain&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time resources are not evenly allocated, but by contribution — consistent with Document 06 &quot;More-Work-More-Gain Distribution Principle&quot; and Document 22 &quot;Joint-Contracting Mechanism.&quot; Higher-contribution cultivators obtain more acceleration-domain quotas, but these quotas must be used for outputs that feed back network-wide, not privately retained. Allocation differences come from contribution, not plunder.</p><h3 id="_2-3-exit-fairness-all-may-exit" tabindex="-1">2.3 Exit Fairness: All May Exit <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-exit-fairness-all-may-exit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Exit Fairness: All May Exit&quot;">​</a></h3><p>In the Quest Domain&#39;s trial design, all participants hold unconditional exit right (linking Entry 520 trial-design ethical boundary). In the acceleration domain&#39;s deduction, cultivators may at any moment suspend and return to reality. No one is &quot;trapped&quot; in the time domain — this fundamentally contrasts with predatory-faction systems where &quot;once the protagonist enters a secret realm he is forced to clear it.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-quantitative-indicators-of-time-fairness" tabindex="-1">III. Quantitative Indicators of Time Fairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-quantitative-indicators-of-time-fairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Quantitative Indicators of Time Fairness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The dual-track time domain&#39;s time fairness is not a slogan, but has quantitative indicators:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Indicator</th><th>Definition</th><th>Target Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Time-Domain Qualification Coverage</td><td>Proportion of Myriad Ranks obtaining time-domain use qualification</td><td>≥99%</td></tr><tr><td>Time-Quota Gini Coefficient</td><td>Inequality of acceleration-domain quota allocation among Myriad Ranks</td><td>≤0.3</td></tr><tr><td>Feedback Rate</td><td>Proportion of acceleration-domain outputs feeding back to the Alaya Network</td><td>=100%</td></tr><tr><td>Exit Rate</td><td>Actual freedom of Quest-Domain participants exercising exit right</td><td>=100%</td></tr><tr><td>Myriad-Rank Access Rate</td><td>Proportion of five lineages接入 the time domain</td><td>=100%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These indicators are continuously monitored by the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, regularly reported to the Anchor Council. Time fairness may be measured — precisely law-first axiom&#39;s expression in the allocation field.</p><h2 id="iv-time-fairness-and-intergenerational-fairness" tabindex="-1">IV. Time Fairness and Intergenerational Fairness <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-time-fairness-and-intergenerational-fairness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Time Fairness and Intergenerational Fairness&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time fairness is not only intra-generational fairness, but also cross-generational fairness. In predatory-faction systems, the older generation of strong ones occupies time resources through plunder; the new generation of cultivators from the start faces a locked ceiling. The dual-track time domain&#39;s correction:</p><ul><li>Acceleration-domain outputs feed back network-wide; the new generation may directly stand on the previous generation&#39;s deduction results, no need to start from zero;</li><li>The Quest Domain&#39;s civilizational memory sedimentation ensures each generation&#39;s Dao-realization results do not vanish with the individual&#39;s death;</li><li>The joint-contracting mechanism ensures time resources are not permanently occupied by the previous generation, but dynamically adjust by contribution.</li></ul><p>Intergenerational fairness is time fairness&#39;s extension in time depth — <strong>today&#39;s time allocation may not be at the cost of the time possibilities of ten thousand generations later</strong>.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: time fairness ensures every bit of time resource flows to contributors not plunderers, avoiding time inefficiently monopolized and wasted</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: directly cuts off &quot;the strong monopolizing time,&quot; this most covert form of plunder; time fairness itself is anti-predation axiom&#39;s legislation in the time dimension</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system time allocation decided by force — whoever has bigger fists secludes longer; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s time allocation decided by contribution; force cannot redeem time</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: time qualification coverage ≥99%, Myriad-Rank access rate =100%; time fairness covers all beings of the five lineages</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: time-allocation law, quota formula, exit mechanism all public; newly merged planes接入 the same time-fairness system; the allocation infrastructure leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time fairness is not an abstract philosophical ideal, but the dual-track time-domain system&#39;s institutional design goal. When qualification fairness, allocation fairness, exit fairness are simultaneously realized, time is no longer the strong&#39;s private property, but Myriad Ranks&#39; public resource — <strong>this is republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39; true fulfillment in the time dimension</strong>. Time fairness is the dual-track time-domain system&#39;s most profound political-philosophical promise.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/06-多劳多得分配原理.html">Entry 06 · More-Work-More-Gain Distribution Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource Allocation Joint-Contracting Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./638_模块3-时间域哲学-掠夺派时间观的哲学批判.html">Entry 638 · Philosophical Critique of Predatory-Faction Time-View</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',35)])])}const f=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,f as default};
